---
import TextPage from '../components/TextPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<TextPage
  title="Terms of Use"
  description={`The terms for using ${SITE.domain} and for listing a business on it.`}
  path="/terms/"
  updated="15 October 2026"
>
  <p>
    By using {SITE.domain} ("the site", "we", "us") you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the site.
  </p>

  <h2>What the site is</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.domain} is a directory of local businesses in Belagavi (Belgaum), Karnataka. We help you find and contact
    businesses. We are not a party to any arrangement you make with them: we don't provide the services listed, take
    bookings, handle payments or charge commission.
  </p>

  <h2>Listings and accuracy</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We try to keep listings accurate, but details such as phone numbers, hours and services can change. Listings are provided "as is", without any guarantee.</li>
    <li>A "Verified" badge means we confirmed the business's details with them at the time. It is not an endorsement of the quality of their work.</li>
    <li>Prices shown on category pages are rough local guides, not quotes. Always confirm the price with the business before work starts.</li>
    <li>"Featured" listings are paid placements and are always labelled.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Dealing with businesses</h2>
  <p>
    Any work, purchase or appointment is between you and the business. Check credentials, agree on the price and scope in
    advance, and keep receipts. We are not responsible for the services, products, conduct or pricing of any business
    listed on the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Listing your business</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Information you send us must be accurate, and you must be the owner of the business or authorised to list it.</li>
    <li>You give us permission to publish the details you send, including your business name, phone numbers, address and description.</li>
    <li>We may edit listings for clarity and consistency, and may refuse or remove any listing, for example if it is misleading, unlawful or the number no longer works.</li>
    <li>Basic listings are free. Featured listings are offered on terms we agree with you separately.</li>
    <li>You can ask us to update or remove your listing at any time through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>Please don't:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>copy the directory in bulk, or scrape listings to send spam or unsolicited calls;</li>
    <li>submit false listings or impersonate a business;</li>
    <li>try to disrupt the site or get around its security.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Content and trademarks</h2>
  <p>
    The design, text and arrangement of the site belong to us. Business names, logos and descriptions belong to their
    owners. Photos credited to Wikimedia Commons are used under their own licences.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of the site or from
    dealings with any business you find on it.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes and governing law</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms; the date at the top shows when they last changed. These terms are governed by the laws of
    India, and the courts at Belagavi, Karnataka have jurisdiction over any dispute.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.</p>
</TextPage>
